# Step 1: SCAN — Read-Only Repository Exploration

## Objective
Understand the codebase structure, existing patterns, and constraints before making any changes.

## Artifacts
- [ ] Directory tree listing
- [ ] Technology stack identification (MQL5 version, broker account types)
- [ ] Existing EA inventory (names, strategies, symbols, timeframes)
- [ ] Include library audit (CPipNormalizer, CRiskGuard, etc.)
- [ ] Anti-pattern baseline (current violations)

## Template
```
PROJECT: {{project_name}}
SCANNED: {{timestamp}}
FILES: {{file_count}} | LOC: {{loc_count}}
STACK: MQL5 {{mql5_version}} | MetaEditor {{metaeditor_build}}
